#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdevelop; integrates a lot of tools, scripts, and templates in a common "
"user interface. Basically it consists of"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"several <link linkend=\"uimodes-survey\">user interface modes</link> from "
"which you can select the look and feel of the workspace,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"an <link linkend=\"applicationwizard\">&appwizard;</link> which aids you in "
"setting up a new project,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"several <link linkend=\"makesystems\">project management systems</link> "
"which aid in building and managing your project,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"some <link linkend=\"editing\">editing tools</link> to easily work on your "
"program texts"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"various <link linkend=\"file-browsers\">file browsers</link> providing you "
"different views on your file system,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"various <link linkend=\"class-browsers\">class browsers</link> to aid you in "
"maintaining the classes and their relationships of your object-oriented "
"programming project,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"a <link linkend=\"debugger\">debugger interface</link> to find and remove "
"program errors from within &kdevelop;, and"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"several <link linkend=\"plugin-tools\">plugin tools</link>, extensible "
"modules which can be loaded at runtime and on demand. This allows you to "
"only turn on those features you really need."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "a set of other diagnosis, documentation, and optimization helper tools."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "In fact there are three &kdevelop;-based applications:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kdevelop; IDE &mdash; this is the place where you will usually work."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The stand-alone &kdevelop; Assistant documentation browser &mdash; isolates "
"all the powerful documentation facilities of the &kdevelop; IDE in a "
"separate tool. This comes in handy when you want to look up some programming "
"documentation but do not want to start the full IDE."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kdevelop; Designer &mdash; enhances the &Qt; User Interface Designer by "
"&kde; specific elements and integrates nicely in the &kdevelop; IDE."
msgstr ""

