#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a novel user interface approach optimizing both work space and "
"intuitive handling of the tools."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All tool views are docked in a tabbar fashion around the mainframe area. "
"They are grouped left, bottom, and right according to the services provided."
