#, no-c-format
msgid "<link>Tabbed Pages</link>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editor and browser views will be stacked in a tabbed window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link>Toplevel Windows</link>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All editor, browser, and tool views will be toplevel windows directly on the "
"desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main widget only contains the menu, toolbars, and statusbar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Switch User Interface Modes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "switch modes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "switch UI modes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To switch the user interface mode select <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure KDevelop...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from "
"the menus. The <guilabel>Customize KDevelop</guilabel> dialog will pop up, "
"where you have to select <guilabel>User Interface</guilabel> in the left "
"hand tree. This will display the settings page shown below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select a user interface mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "(Older &kdevelop; versions provide the top mode selection section only.)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Major User-Interface Mode</guilabel> section select the "
"radio button of the user interface mode you want to work in."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Dependent on the user interface mode you selected, other configuration "
"sections will become available where you can taylor more details of the look "
"and feel to your preferences. See the <link linkend=\"setup-ui\">Selecting "
"the User Interface</link> chapter for more detail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do not forget to restart &kdevelop; in order to let your selections take "
"effect."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Maximize the Work Space Area"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:184 kdevelop-survey.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "work space"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
