#, no-c-format
msgid "Project Management Systems"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "project management"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Globally, a project will rely on some form of project management system. "
"&kdevelop; offers four <emphasis>project management systems</emphasis> the "
"programmer can select from when creating a new project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"automake-project\">Automake projects</link> use the &GNU; "
"standard development tools."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"qmake-project\">QMake projects</link> use the trolltech "
"QMake project manager."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"ant-project\">ANT projects</link> use the Apache ANT project "
"manager for &Java; development."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-survey.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"custom-project\">Custom projects</link> require you to "
"maintain your own <filename>Makefiles</filename>."
msgstr ""

